# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, a file written with LF and later saved by a Windows editor as
# CRLF shows up as a whole-file rewrite: the README produced a 402-insertion /
# 402-deletion diff in which not one character had actually changed. That noise
# makes `git log -p` useless as a project timeline.
#
# `text=auto` stores everything as LF in the repository and checks it out with
# the platform's native endings.

* text=auto

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tif binary
*.pt  binary
*.pth binary
*.npz binary
*.sqlite3 binary
